{"title":"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_22\">Problem 22</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 22\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the number of pairs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/b/98b7e4c455672c30d743cce7506408a40cb68129.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(m, n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"47\" height=\"18\" /> of integers which satisfy the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/4/9448780779e90302f208d749cab04adbef4f8eb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m^3 + 6m^2 + 5m = 27n^3 + 27n^2 + 9n + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"317\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/7/967baafd06973b6cbee23ba169d5102f07bf8b57.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }0\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }1\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }3\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }9\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }\\infty$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"362\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The equation is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/a/e8a50bcacfe53c2c2df3a99621635eaff8780cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m(m+1)(m+5) = 27n^3 + 27n^2 + 9n + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"334\" height=\"21\" />. Taking mod 3, we get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/2/172c94112116d77856df52843bbcbc190d2a37af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m(m+1)(m+2)=1 (\\bmod 3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"230\" height=\"18\" />. However, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/d/9fd70df3507e793ce19134418445090156b52150.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m(m+1)(m+2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"137\" height=\"18\" /> is always divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> for any integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />. Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e2072d72a3d6cf8b595da56c87c22eb69e90e19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)} 0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"50\" height=\"28\" />\nSolution by mickyboy789\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME\" title=\"1979 AHSME\">1979 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1979 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1979\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" r